// ============================================================
// Chapter 0
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// Node tags (presentation mode):
//   cutscene = no dialogue box
//   Jaycord     = Jaycord chat UI
//   face     = normal dialogue box
//   MHM      = MHM chat UI
//   CrowGPT  = CrowGPT chat UI
//
// Custom commands used (implement in engine):
//   <<camera ACTION TARGET>>   camera move (pan / zoom / zoom_out / closeup / push_in)
//   <<bg NAME>>                swap background
//   <<show NAME>> / <<hide NAME>>  show or hide an item / character
//   <<sfx NAME>>               play sound effect
//   <<fade_out SECONDS>> / <<fade_in SECONDS>>
//   <<chapter_end NUMBER>>
// ============================================================


title: Start
tags: MHM cutscene
---
<<declare $linkMood = "curious">>
<<declare $looksTaken = 0>>
<<declare $checkedJaycord = false>>
<<declare $checkedDate = false>>
<<declare $checkedRoom = false>>
<<declare $questionsAsked = 0>>
<<declare $askedWho = false>>
<<declare $askedLLM = false>>
<<declare $askedCrow = false>>
<<declare $askedMistakes = false>>
<<declare $askedYear = false>>
<<declare $askedMax = false>>

<<bg apartment_exterior_night>>
<<camera push_in window_3f>>
<<bg room_2026>>
<<camera pan room_2026>>
<<camera zoom leo_desk>>
<<sfx notification>>
<<show jaycord_badge_max>>
<<jump C0_MaxChat>>
===


title: C0_MaxChat
tags: MHM
---
Max: yo, you still up?
Leo: Yeah, why?
Max: found something interesting
Leo: You said that last time and it was a cat video.
Max: this is different. trust me
Max: See what's next #link
Max: don't overthink it, just click

-> What is it?
    Max: you'll see :)
    <<set $linkMood to "curious">>
-> Is this a virus?
    Max: lol no. would i do that to you
    <<set $linkMood to "suspicious">>
-> Click the link
    <<set $linkMood to "curious">>

<<jump C0_TheJump>>
===


title: C0_TheJump
tags: face
---
<<camera zoom monitor>>
<<sfx static>>
<<fade_out 1>>
<<wait 2>>
<<sfx boot_chime>>
<<bg room_2027>>
<<fade_in 1>>
<<camera zoom_out monitor_2027>>

Leo: My head... ehhh
Leo: W-what just happened...?
<<if $linkMood == "suspicious">>
    Leo: I knew that link was sketchy.
<<else>>
    Leo: Max, what did you send me?
<<endif>>
Leo: Huh? Jaycord? Everything looks so different...
Leo: This isn't my room. Is it?

<<jump C0_LookAround>>
===


title: C0_LookAround
tags: face
---
-> Check Jaycord <<if not $checkedJaycord>>
    <<set $checkedJaycord to true>>
    Leo: This is...Jaycord? Where is MHM?
    <<show jaycord_max_profile>>
    Leo: "Last online: 8 year ago"? That can't be right. We were just talking.
    Leo: What happened to him?
    <<hide jaycord_max_profile>>
    Leo: Our chat history... it's gone.
    Leo: Why the link is still here? What's going on right now?
-> Look at the date <<if not $checkedDate>>
    <<set $checkedDate to true>>
    <<show screen_date_2027>>
    Leo: 2027...? No way.
    <<hide screen_date_2027>>
-> Look around the room <<if not $checkedRoom>>
    <<set $checkedRoom to true>>
    <<camera pan room_2027>>
    Leo: My stuff... some of it's here, but it's all moved around.

<<set $looksTaken to $looksTaken + 1>>

<<if $looksTaken >= 2>>
    <<jump C0_Knock>>
<<else>>
    <<jump C0_LookAround>>
<<endif>>
===


title: C0_Knock
tags: face
---
<<sfx knock>>
Leo: ...Someone's here?

-> Go to the door
    Leo: Coming!
-> Stay still
    <<sfx knock_loud>>
    Leo: Okay, okay, I'm coming.

<<show door>>
<<sfx door_open>>
Leo: Who's there?
Leo: ......

<<bg hallway_empty>>
<<show delivery_box>>
Leo: Nobody...? Just a box.
Leo: "For Leo, from Max."
<<if $checkedJaycord>>
    Leo: A gift from Max...? But he's been offline for a year.
<<else>>
    Leo: A gift from Max...? When did he send this?
<<endif>>

<<bg room_2027>>
<<show box_open>>
Note: Figured you'd need a guide. Don't panic. - Best friend M
Leo: Don't panic? Easy for you to say huh.

<<camera closeup crow>>
<<sfx crow_power_on>>
<<show crow>>
Leo: H-huh?! Wait, what?!

<<jump C0_MeetCrow>>
===


title: C0_MeetCrow
tags: face
---
CrowGPT: Hey there, Leo! My name is CrowGPT, or Crow for short :)
CrowGPT: I'm your personal AI Companion Friend. Ask me anything!
<<jump C0_CrowHub>>
===


title: C0_CrowHub
tags: face
---
-> Who are you? <<if not $askedWho>>
    <<set $askedWho to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: I'm an LLM, built to help you with anything: daily tasks, nagging questions, or just being someone to talk to.

-> What is an LLM? <<if $askedWho and not $askedLLM>>
    <<set $askedLLM to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: It stands for Large Language Model.
    CrowGPT: I learned from a huge amount of text, so I can understand what you say and answer in a human-like way.

-> Why are you a crow? <<if not $askedCrow>>
    <<set $askedCrow to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: That's just how I was designed! As an LLM, I could take any form.
    CrowGPT: My developers thought a crow would be the most unique and friendly. Also, crows are pretty smart.

-> Can you make mistakes? <<if $askedLLM and not $askedMistakes>>
    <<set $askedMistakes to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: Definitely. I can sound very sure of myself and still be wrong.
    CrowGPT: For anything important, check with a reliable source too.

-> What year is it? <<if not $askedYear>>
    <<set $askedYear to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: It's 2027!
    Leo: 2027... so it's real.
    CrowGPT: You seem surprised. Did something happen?
    Leo: ehhh.
    CrowGPT: I'm all ears. Well, I don't have ears. But you know what I mean.
    Leo: No...just, nothing.

-> Do you know Max? <<if not $askedMax>>
    <<set $askedMax to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: Searching... Here’s what I found!
    CrowGPT: Max Vanderstraat, Racing Team Director and three-time Grand Prix Champion.
    CrowGPT: Max Norberg, Chess Grandmaster.
    CrowGPT: Max Rivers, Award-Winning Musician.
    CrowGPT: Max Raven, Research & Development Lead in Raven Company.
    CrowGPT: Max Dowling, Youth Football Prodigy.
    Leo: ...None of those. I mean my friend Max, or who is your previous owner?
    CrowGPT: My registration says I was set up for you by someone named "M."
    CrowGPT: That's all I've got, sorry!
    Leo: So Max knew this would happen...


-> I want to go outside. <<if $questionsAsked >= 2>>
    <<jump C0_Outside>>

<<jump C0_CrowHub>>
===


title: C0_Outside
tags: face
---
CrowGPT: Want me to come with you? I fit in a bag. Mostly.
Leo: ...Sure. I'm not familiar with this place so I don't think I should go alone. 

<<bg hallway_2027>>
<<show cleaning_robot>>
<<camera pan hallway_2027>>
<<hide cleaning_robot>>
<<sfx door_open>>
<<bg street_2027>>
<<camera pan street_2027>>

Leo: This is... my street?
CrowGPT: Welcome to 2027! Things move fast around here.
Leo: It looks like a different city.
Leo: Almost 30 year...
Leo: Crow, do you believe time travel or transmgration?
CrowGPT: From the perspective of modern physics, traveling to the future is theoretically possible, and the associated time effects have been experimentally verified.
Leo: What if... I mean, just "if." If I were a time traveler from the past, what should I do now?
CrowGPT: If everything around you suddenly feels unfamiliar, the most important thing is to make sure you're safe, confirm who you are, and figure out where you're staying.
CrowGPT: Don't panic. I'm here to support you.

<<show phone>>
<<jump C0_PhoneMax>>
===


title: C0_PhoneMax
tags: phone
---
Leo: Max. What did you do?
System: Message not delivered.
<<jump C0_End>>
===


title: C0_End
tags: face
---
<<hide phone>>
Leo: ...I need to find him. I need to figure out what is going.
CrowGPT: Then let's start looking. I'm good at searching!
<<fade_out 2>>
<<chapter_end 0>>
===